Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.16,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球为什么靠走？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:04.53,TL,,0,0,0,,昨天广州 一场球没打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:06.44,TL,,0,0,0,,有人直接进了八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:09.69,TL,,0,0,0,,西尼亚科娃右肩受伤 赛前退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:13.50,TL,,0,0,0,,就在前一天 她刚打完一场{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘鏖战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.75,TL,,0,0,0,,大阪夺冠后的连胜已经来到第六场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:21.31,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天 她的名字从签表上消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:28.01,TL,,0,0,0,,她的对手刘婧文 一分没打 晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:31.13,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文自己的首轮也打了近{\fs78}3{\fs68}个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.02,TL,,0,0,0,,她多赚的 是整整一天休息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:37.26,TL,,0,0,0,,签表上 她的名字旁边记着一个记号
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}walkover{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.64,TL,,0,0,0,,隔壁场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68} 岁的孙心然这一场打了 {\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.78,TL,,0,0,0,,小时 {\fs78}41{\fs68} 分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.20,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}5{\fs68} 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.68,TL,,0,0,0,,她叫了医疗暂停 缠好绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.98,TL,,0,0,0,,到了决胜盘 绷带拆了硬撑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:55.28,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}5{\fs68} 落后 对方手握赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.74,TL,,0,0,0,,她一分一分往回爬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.66,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七 {\fs78}7{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}3{\fs68} 拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:01.28,TL,,0,0,0,,终场哨响 她哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.08,TL,,0,0,0,,不战而胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.70,TL,,0,0,0,,英文就是 {\fs78}walk{\fs68} {\fs78}over{\fs68} 走着赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.46,TL,,0,0,0,,可一场没开打的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.93,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么偏偏要用一个 走 字？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:13.03,TL,,0,0,0,,因为它根本不是网球发明的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:14.83,TL,,0,0,0,,是从赛马借来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}200{\fs68}年前的英国赛马
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:19.21,TL,,0,0,0,,对手如果全部退赛 只剩一匹马
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:21.37,TL,,0,0,0,,按规矩它也不能直接领奖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:24.81,TL,,0,0,0,,必须自己慢慢走完整个赛道 才算赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:27.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68} 世纪那匹传奇赛马 {\fs78}Eclipse{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.98,TL,,0,0,0,,强到没人敢跟它跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68} 场胜利里差不多一半
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.58,TL,,0,0,0,,是这么 走 出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:35.32,TL,,0,0,0,,后来这个词进了网球 对手来不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:38.09,TL,,0,0,0,,你就等于独自走完了这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,但 {\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 有一条硬线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.88,TL,,0,0,0,,必须是开打之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:45.92,TL,,0,0,0,,只要打了哪怕一分再退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.99,TL,,0,0,0,,那叫退赛 要记比分 算胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.99,0:01:51.60,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文这一场 一分没打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.94,TL,,0,0,0,,不算一场胜利 不进胜负记录
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.24,TL,,0,0,0,,也不进两个人的交手记录
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.52,TL,,0,0,0,,连胜纪录还会在这里断片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:00.05,TL,,0,0,0,,你正处在 {\fs78}19{\fs68} 连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:01.73,TL,,0,0,0,,中间收到一个 {\fs78}walkover{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.13,TL,,0,0,0,,再赢一场 官方连胜是 {\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:06.17,TL,,0,0,0,,不是 {\fs78}21{\fs68} 因为中间那一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:07.87,TL,,0,0,0,,根本不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.28,TL,,0,0,0,,那积分和奖金呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.16,TL,,0,0,0,,这笔账分三层
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA{\fs68} 规则书里写得明明白白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:18.18,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮白捡的 只按上一轮给分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.30,TL,,0,0,0,,打过 赢过之后再收到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:22.17,TL,,0,0,0,,按所达轮次给分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:23.72,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文首轮赢了球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.79,TL,,0,0,0,,所以她{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛的积分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:28.77,TL,,0,0,0,,照拿 她真正多赚的不是积分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:30.31,TL,,0,0,0,,是那一整天的休息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:32.42,TL,,0,0,0,,和对手身上那 {\fs78}2{\fs68} 小时 {\fs78}41{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.11,TL,,0,0,0,,分钟的消耗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:39.80,TL,,0,0,0,,这种事 在最大的舞台上也发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68} 年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.48,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔腹肌撕裂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:45.24,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛前开发布会退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:49.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Unfortunately, as you can imagine,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很遗憾 正如你们能想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:52.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have to pull out from the tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我必须退出这项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:56.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And yeah, that's confirmed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N已经确诊了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:01.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have a tear in the abdominal muscle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我的腹肌撕裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:06.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So the communication is too late,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N通报来得太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:07.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because even like that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N即便如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:09.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was thinking during the whole day{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我考虑了整整一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}about the decision to make.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就是这个决定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:14.20,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯直接走进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.77,TL,,0,0,0,,他职业生涯唯一一个大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:18.59,TL,,0,0,0,,是走进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:22.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2014{\fs68} 年年终总决赛更夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.55,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒在决赛开打前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:27.36,TL,,0,0,0,,约一小时宣布背伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:29.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, good evening.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大家晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm sorry, I'm here in a tracksuit,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很抱歉 我穿着运动服
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and not in a match outfit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而不是比赛服
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:36.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Unfortunately, I'm not match fit{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很遗憾 我的身体状态
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:38.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to play the match tonight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没法打今晚这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:45.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Clearly, I wish it wasn't so.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我真希望不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:46.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You try all year to be ready{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你一整年的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:47.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the ATP World Tour Finals,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N都是为了年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I didn't want it to end this way,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不想让它这样收场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:52.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but I tried everything I could last night.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但昨晚我试了一切办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:56.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Also today, painkillers, treatment,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天也一样 止痛药 治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:59.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}rest, warm up till the very end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N休息 热身 一直撑到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:03.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But just, I can't compete at this level{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我没法在这个级别比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:07.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with Novak, in a Finals like this.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对诺瓦克 还是决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It would be too risky at my age{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以我的年纪 太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to do this right now,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:12.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I hope you understand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望你们能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I wanted to come out personally{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想亲自出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:15.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and excuse myself for not playing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为不能出场向大家致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:17.55,TL,,0,0,0,,德约科维奇不战而冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.79,TL,,0,0,0,,那是这项赛事{\fs78}45{\fs68}年历史上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.63,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛第一次没打成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.38,TL,,0,0,0,,组委会临时拉来穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.12,TL,,0,0,0,,陪德约打了一场表演赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:27.65,TL,,0,0,0,,给买了票的观众一个交代
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.25,TL,,0,0,0,,好玩的在后面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.67,TL,,0,0,0,,收到 {\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.36,TL,,0,0,0,,下一场到底占没占到便宜？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.50,TL,,0,0,0,,先看一对同站对照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68} 年迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.20,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷一站收到两次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 进决赛 还是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.60,TL,,0,0,0,,他赛后自己说 接发不在状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.33,TL,,0,0,0,,开场需要几局找节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:48.93,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛第一盘他 {\fs78}1{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:50.30,TL,,0,0,0,,就交了学费
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:51.62,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后同一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:53.64,TL,,0,0,0,,德约也收到两次 {\fs78}walkover{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:54.90,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:57.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}3{\fs68} 横扫纳达尔夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.51,TL,,0,0,0,,有意思的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.51,0:05:00.76,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔那届半决赛也收到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:01.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}walkover{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:03.44,TL,,0,0,0,,两个受益者在决赛对撞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:05.96,TL,,0,0,0,,一个捧杯 一个亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.65,TL,,0,0,0,,再看德约自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:11.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68} 年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:14.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛德米纳尔退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:17.51,TL,,0,0,0,,他省力进四强 半决赛直落{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:18.81,TL,,0,0,0,,可决赛呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:24.27,TL,,0,0,0,,被阿尔卡拉斯打得没有还手之力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:27.20,TL,,0,0,0,,多休的那一天 没换来冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.30,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯走进决赛那次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 先拿一盘 最后连丢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:33.97,TL,,0,0,0,,格拉诺列斯 {\fs78}2016{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:36.15,TL,,0,0,0,,年在法网躲开了纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:39.69,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮就被蒂姆送走 只多留了一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:40.74,TL,,0,0,0,,佩内塔 {\fs78}2013{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.10,TL,,0,0,0,,年温网收到阿扎伦卡的退赛礼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:46.01,TL,,0,0,0,,下一场先吞一个 {\fs78}0{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}6{\fs68} 再逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.99,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了自己{\fs78}5{\fs68}年来在温网的最好成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:52.07,TL,,0,0,0,,白捡的便宜 她兑现得最实在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.03,TL,,0,0,0,,而退赛的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:58.93,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒 {\fs78}2014{\fs68} 年退掉总决赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:01.01,TL,,0,0,0,,整整一周后 戴维斯杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.98,TL,,0,0,0,,周五他带伤输了单打 周六双打赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:06.11,TL,,0,0,0,,周日直落{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘锁定胜局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:09.06,TL,,0,0,0,,帮瑞士拿到队史第一座戴维斯杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.38,TL,,0,0,0,,当时被骂 留力 的一次退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.53,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}天后 成了布局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.22,TL,,0,0,0,,把这些样本摆在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:17.28,TL,,0,0,0,,收到 {\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 的人下一场是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:18.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68} 胜 {\fs78}3{\fs68} 负
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:20.65,TL,,0,0,0,,也有统计研究专门算过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:22.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 对下一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:25.07,TL,,0,0,0,,测不出任何正向或负向的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.56,TL,,0,0,0,,所以结论可能有点反直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.10,TL,,0,0,0,,省力不等于躺赢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.49,TL,,0,0,0,,没打比赛也不等于没状态
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:32.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}walkover{\fs68} 送走的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.55,TL,,0,0,0,,从来不是胜负 是确定性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.65,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮 休息了一整天的刘婧文
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:43.65,TL,,0,0,0,,对上刚从悬崖边爬回来的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:44.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:47.71,TL,,0,0,0,,就是这条规矩最新的一次现场考试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:49.22,TL,,0,0,0,,要是由你来定规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:51.65,TL,,0,0,0,,一分没打就晋级 积分照拿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:52.94,TL,,0,0,0,,还白赚一天休息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.22,TL,,0,0,0,,这条规矩 该留吗？
